 Bakay blood air,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0421:b002:l034","ordinal":327916,"en":"In his youth, the otter"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0421:b002:l035","ordinal":327917,"en":"Who didn't wear it."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0421:b002:l036","ordinal":327918,"en":"When you see Kan Bakay,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0421:b002:l037","ordinal":327919,"en":"Thick unbeliever."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0421:b002:l038","ordinal":327920,"en":"The black alger ate the bait,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0421:b002:l039","ordinal":327921,"en":"God took old age,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0421:b002:l040","ordinal":327922,"en":"Enraged,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0421:b003:l001","ordinal":327923,"en":"Tears are shed,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0421:b003:l002","ordinal":327924,"en":"Olarman Bakai, the old man cried,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0421:b003:l003","ordinal":327925,"en":"Weeping bitterly,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0421:b003:l004","ordinal":327926,"en":"He cried bitterly,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0421:b003:l005","ordinal":327927,"en":"Unseen poor noisy people,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0421:b003:l006","ordinal":327928,"en":"Sorrowful people who suffer a lot,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0421:b003:l007","ordinal":327929,"en":"Songs are written from the sky,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0421:b003:l008","ordinal":327930,"en":"Many passions are revealed,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0421:b003:l009","ordinal":327931,"en":"They stood up to see each other."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0421:b003:l010","ordinal":327932,"en":"Behind them,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0421:b003:l011","ordinal":327933,"en":"Hero Seitek, Kulchoro"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0421:b003:l012","ordinal":327934,"en":"As soon as they arrived,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0421:b003:l013","ordinal":327935,"en":"Grandfather Bakay in his old age,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0421:b003:l014","ordinal":327936,"en":"When you see Er Seitek,"}]
